flowchart TD
    A([preprocessDocument\ncalled]) --> B[splitIntoPages\npage boundary detection\nnewline and form-feed\nseparators]

    B --> C[for each page chunk:\nclassifyChunk\npattern matching against\nsection detection patterns]

    C --> D{Chunk\nclassification}
    D -- REPAIR_QUOTE --> E[repair quote section]
    D -- ASSESSOR_REPORT --> F[assessor report section]
    D -- POLICE_REPORT --> G[police report section]
    D -- VEHICLE_INFO --> H[vehicle info section]
    D -- UNKNOWN --> I[unclassified section]

    E --> J[buildPreprocessorOutput\nassemble classified sections\ninto PreprocessorOutput]
    F --> J
    G --> J
    H --> J
    I --> J

    J --> K([return PreprocessorOutput\nwith typed sections\nand raw text])

    style A fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style K fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
